This is a '''list of [[List of sports rivalries|rivalry]] games''' in [[college football]]. The list also shows any trophy awarded to the winner of the rivalry between the teams.{{efn|The list only shows games that have an associated Wikipedia article for either the name of the game or the trophy. Other series have been played more times than games listed here that have no Wikipedia article. For example, in the FBS, Washington State and Oregon State have played more than 100 times, and in the FCS, Harvard and Brown have played over 100 times.}}
